Written for the C/C++ lane of the graph-accuracy run (HANDOFF.md, OPEN product
defects, C/C++: `#line` after same-line comment not blanked,
preprocessor.cpp). The compiler honours both directives: the program prints
"answer at 951" and exits 0. `answer` is defined only by the expansion of
DEFINE_GETTER and main calls it only through CALL, so both come from the
preprocessed pass (cbm_preprocess_with_map, then the line map). The graph must
report the definition answer at main.c:13, main at main.c:16 and the call
main -> answer at main.c:18. Without the fix the expansion keeps
`#line 900 "gen.y"` / `#line 950 "gen.y"`, and build_line_map places answer
and the call in gen.y (lines 900 and 952), outside main.c.
